---
---

<section id="hero">
	<div class="hero-media">
		<img src="/rioli.webp" alt="Río Li, China" fetchpriority="high" />
		<div class="hero-fade"></div>

		<div class="hero-top">
			<div class="china-wrap">
				<h1>CHINA</h1>
				<div class="china-overlay">
					<p class="hero-days">14 DÍAS Y 13 NOCHES</p>
					<a
						href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send/?phone=522211201356&text=Hola%2C+quiero+viajar+con+Ala+Libre%2C+quiero+comenzar+ahora&type=phone_number&app_absent=0"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener noreferrer"
						class="btn-outline">Cotizar con un diseñador de viajes</a
					>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

	</div>

	<div class="hero-bottom">
		<p class="eyebrow">INTINERARIO</p>
		<h2>ALAS DE GRULLA DORADA</h2>
		<p class="description">
			Descubre China en 14 días de ensueño: historia milenaria en Beijing y Xi'an, paisajes de
			fantasía en Guilin y Zhangjiajie, y la modernidad deslumbrante de Shanghái. ¡Un recorrido
			lleno de cultura, naturaleza y aventuras únicas!
		</p>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	#hero {
		position: relative;
		width: 100%;
		overflow: hidden;
		background: #00002e;
		font-family: 'League Spartan', sans-serif;
	}

	.hero-media {
		position: relative;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100vh;
		min-height: 460px;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.hero-media img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
		object-position: center 25%;
		display: block;
	}

	.hero-fade {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		background: linear-gradient(
			180deg,
			rgba(0, 0, 46, 0.1) 0%,
			rgba(0, 0, 46, 0.05) 30%,
			rgba(0, 0, 46, 0.25) 65%,
			rgba(0, 0, 46, 0.7) 100%
		);
	}

	.hero-top {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		z-index: 2;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: flex-start;
		padding: calc(4vh + 300px) 6vw 0;
	}

	.china-wrap {
		display: inline-block;
	}

	.hero-top h1 {
		margin: 0;
		color: #ffffff;
		font-weight: 800;
		font-size: clamp(64px, 13vw, 170px);
		line-height: 0.9;
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
		text-align: center;
		text-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
	}

	.china-overlay {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		width: 100%;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	.hero-days {
		margin: 0.4em 0;
		width: 100%;
		color: #ffffff;
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 54px;
		text-align: justify;
		text-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
	}

	.btn-outline {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		box-sizing: border-box;
		color: #ffffff;
		text-decoration: none;
		text-align: center;
		font-family: 'League Spartan', sans-serif;
		font-weight: 500;
		font-size: 25px;
		padding: 12px 22px;
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22);
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
		backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
		transition:
			background 0.2s ease,
			border-color 0.2s ease;
	}

	.btn-outline:hover {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
		border-color: #ffffff;
	}

	.hero-bottom {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 2;
		padding: 32px 6vw 56px;
		max-width: 900px;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		margin: 0 0 6px;
		color: #ffffff;
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 14px;
		letter-spacing: 0.15em;
	}

	.hero-bottom h2 {
		margin: 0 0 20px;
		color: #ffffff;
		font-weight: 800;
		font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);
		line-height: 1.1;
	}

	.description {
		margin: 0;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
		font-weight: 400;
		font-size: 16px;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	@media (max-width: 700px) {
		.hero-media {
			height: 58vh;
			min-height: 380px;
		}

		.hero-top {
			padding: calc(3vh + 290px) 6vw 0;
		}

		.hero-top h1 {
			text-align: left;
		}

		.china-overlay {
			width: 100%;
			align-items: flex-start;
			gap: 0.6rem;
		}

		.hero-days {
			width: 100%;
			text-align: left;
			font-size: 20px;
		}

		.btn-outline {
			width: 100%;
			display: block;
			font-size: 14px;
			padding: 10px 16px;
		}

		.hero-bottom {
			padding: 24px 6vw 40px;
		}
	}
</style>
